<section class="research-section" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title"><h2 id="projects-title">Projects</h2><div class="records"><article class="record"><div class="date">2025–2027</div><div><h3>Micromobility as a post-war tool for rebuilding mobility in Ukraine: trade-off perspectives of public transport integration</h3><p class="meta">Principal Investigator · European Union; DAAD-led consortium with Campus France, PAUSE and UNIMED</p><p class="details">Examines micromobility and public transport operations, their interaction, and stakeholder perspectives on integration.</p></div></article><article class="record"><div class="date">2023–2024</div><div><h3>Digital information, modelling and manufacturing for post-war reconstruction of the built environment — Micromobility</h3><p class="meta">Research Associate · UK Research and Innovation / Universities UK International; UK–Ukraine Twinning Initiative</p><p class="details">Led comparative analysis of cycling and micromobility in the EU, UK and Ukraine, including 34 stakeholder interviews and policy-oriented recommendations.</p></div></article><article class="record"><div class="date">2022–2025</div><div><h3>Sustainable Urban Transport Policy in Europe</h3><p class="meta">Principal Investigator · Erasmus+ Jean Monnet Module</p><p class="details">Led educational and capacity-building activities on EU sustainable urban transport policy for Ukrainian universities and stakeholders.</p></div></article><article class="record"><div class="date">2023</div><div><h3>Summer school and training courses for EU &amp; UA</h3><p class="meta">Co-Investigator · EIT Urban Mobility RIS Education</p><p class="details">Designed and delivered training on city logistics and sustainable transport.</p></div></article><article class="record"><div class="date">2022</div><div><h3>EIT Urban Mobility RIS HUB Poland</h3><p class="meta">Research Associate · EIT Urban Mobility RIS Education</p><p class="details">Developed educational content on European sustainable urban transport policy and supported project reporting.</p></div></article><article class="record"><div class="date">2017–2021</div><div><h3>Master in Smart Transport and Logistics for Cities</h3><p class="meta">Co-Investigator · Erasmus+ Capacity Building in Higher Education</p><p class="details">Contributed to the development and delivery of the postgraduate programme and coordinated student training activities.</p></div></article><article class="record"><div class="date">2020–2022</div><div><h3>New mechanisms for horizontal collaboration for sustainable development of transport and logistics systems</h3><p class="meta">Research Associate · Ministry of Education and Science of Ukraine</p><p class="details">Investigated city logistics and last-mile delivery through statistical analysis, multi-criteria methods and mathematical modelling.</p></div></article><article class="record"><div class="date">2020</div><div><h3>Development of scenarios for improving the car parking system in the central part of Kharkiv</h3><p class="meta">Research Associate · Ministry of Education and Science of Ukraine</p><p class="details">Contributed to data processing and methodology development.</p></div></article></div></section>
